WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.458 --> 00:00:04.417
这是一座城，近八百年前的样子。
This is a city as it looked nearly 800 years ago.

2
00:00:06.167 --> 00:00:10.583
今天，这里还有许多人家枕河而居。
Today, many homes here still sit right on the water.

3
00:00:14.708 --> 00:00:19.083
六千年前，这里的先民就在水边种稻。
Six thousand years ago, people here were already growing rice by the water.

4
00:00:19.458 --> 00:00:26.000
上世纪90年代，考古队在城东的草鞋山，找到了那时的水田。
In the 1990s, archaeologists found their paddy fields at Caoxieshan, east of the city.

5
00:00:28.417 --> 00:00:34.458
公元前514年，伍子胥“相土尝水，象天法地”。
In 514 BC, Wu Zixu tasted the water and read the land.

6
00:00:34.833 --> 00:00:39.500
周回四十七里，陆门八，水门八。
Forty-seven li around: eight land gates, eight water gates.

7
00:00:39.875 --> 00:00:44.708
此后两千五百多年，城址基本没有动过。
In the 2,500 years since, the city has stayed roughly where it was.

8
00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:52.250
589年，因城西南的姑苏山，它第一次叫“苏州”。
In 589 it was first called Suzhou, after Mount Gusu to the southwest.

9
00:00:52.625 --> 00:00:57.833
610年，江南运河开通，从镇江一直到杭州。
In 610 the Jiangnan Canal opened, running from Zhenjiang to Hangzhou.

10
00:00:58.208 --> 00:01:02.125
城里的船，从此能一路开到洛阳。
Boats from town could now reach Luoyang.

11
00:01:04.167 --> 00:01:08.167
825年，白居易来苏州做刺史。
In 825, the poet Bai Juyi came to govern Suzhou.

12
00:01:08.542 --> 00:01:15.417
他在诗里写：“绿浪东西南北水，红栏三百九十桥。”
In a poem he wrote of green water on every side and red rails on 390 bridges.

13
00:01:15.792 --> 00:01:20.042
他还开了七里山塘河，一直通到虎丘。
He also dug the seven-li Shantang canal out to Tiger Hill.

14
00:01:20.417 --> 00:01:25.417
虎丘塔建于961年，塔顶偏了2.34米。
Tiger Hill Pagoda dates from 961. Its top is 2.34 m off centre.

15
00:01:28.417 --> 00:01:34.333
1229年，平江府把整座城刻上了石碑。
In 1229, the whole city was cut into a stone stele.

16
00:01:34.708 --> 00:01:38.375
城里的河道横平竖直，排成格子。
The canals ran straight, in a grid.

17
00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:41.542
街巷大多贴着河走。
Most streets followed the water.

18
00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:51.208
平江路一带，不少人家前门开在街上，后门出去就是河。
Along Pingjiang Road, many houses open onto the street in front and onto the canal behind.

19
00:01:51.583 --> 00:01:56.625
近八百年后，许多街巷水道还对得上。
Nearly eight centuries on, many streets and canals still line up.

20
00:01:57.625 --> 00:02:01.125
这块碑，今天立在苏州文庙。
The stele stands today in the Confucian Temple of Suzhou.

21
00:02:06.458 --> 00:02:10.792
明清两代，这里是全国最富庶的城市之一。
Under the Ming and Qing, it was one of the richest cities in China.

22
00:02:11.167 --> 00:02:15.583
有钱人家修园子，把水引进了院里。
Wealthy families built gardens and brought the water inside.

23
00:02:15.958 --> 00:02:21.250
1509年，王献臣在城东北开始修拙政园。
In 1509, Wang Xianchen began the Humble Administrator's Garden in the northeast of the city.

24
00:02:21.625 --> 00:02:30.000
1759年，徐扬画的《姑苏繁华图》长12米，画了一万两千多人。
In 1759, Xu Yang painted the city on a 12-metre scroll, with more than 12,000 people in it.

25
00:02:32.042 --> 00:02:35.708
1860年，战火烧到阊门外。
In 1860, war reached Chang Gate.

26
00:02:37.083 --> 00:02:40.375
山塘的街市几乎烧光了。
Shantang's market streets were almost all burned.

27
00:02:42.917 --> 00:02:48.042
1982年，苏州成为首批国家历史文化名城。
In 1982, Suzhou became one of China's first historic cities.

28
00:02:48.417 --> 00:02:53.708
1986年的总体规划写明“全面保护古城风貌”。
The 1986 master plan called for "full protection of the old city's character".

29
00:02:54.083 --> 00:03:01.042
平江路和山塘街后来都整修过，河街并行的格局留了下来。
Pingjiang Road and Shantang Street were later restored, their streets still running beside the canals.

30
00:03:01.417 --> 00:03:08.125
盘门、胥门、阊门、相门一带的城墙和城门，也陆续修缮。
The walls and gates around Pan, Xu, Chang and Xiang Gates were repaired one after another.

31
00:03:10.417 --> 00:03:14.667
新城区放在了护城河外，一东一西。
The new districts went outside the moat, one to the east and one to the west.

32
00:03:16.542 --> 00:03:24.125
1990年先建西边的新区，四年后，东边的工业园区开工。
The western district came first, in 1990. Four years later, work began on the industrial park in the east.

33
00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:30.042
工业园区由中国和新加坡两国政府合作开发。
The park was developed jointly by the governments of China and Singapore.

34
00:03:32.083 --> 00:03:37.708
东边最高的楼是苏州国际金融中心，450米。
The tallest tower in the east, Suzhou IFS, is 450 m.

35
00:03:38.333 --> 00:03:44.250
古城里的房子大多不到25米，北寺塔有76米。
Most buildings in the old city are under 25 m. North Temple Pagoda is 76 m.

36
00:03:47.083 --> 00:03:52.375
从高处看，苏州城里城外仍然到处是河。
From above, Suzhou is still full of canals, inside the old city and out.

37
00:03:54.750 --> 00:04:00.208
其中不少河道，在1229年的碑上就已经刻着。
Many of them were already carved on the stele in 1229.

38
00:04:03.875 --> 00:04:07.750
“君到姑苏见，人家尽枕河。”—— 杜荀鹤
"Come to Gusu, and you will see every home pillowed on the river." — Du Xunhe, Tang
